*> vybe-test: cobol/currency_sign/currency_sign_runtime_compute
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_currency_sign.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUR14.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    CURRENCY SIGN IS "$".
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 SRC PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 100.00.
01 DST PIC $ZZ9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE SRC = SRC + 25.
    MOVE SRC TO DST
    IF DST > 0
        DISPLAY "COMPUTE"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "COMPUTE" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "COMPUTE"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [COMPUTE] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.

